                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f963f5a9-2ab7-3ef3-a122-779ff8edea85",
                        "entry_id": "37b3760b-e7a5-33e1-9149-15f81966d953",
                        "glosses": [
                            "manners"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "4db6e2d0-8c54-4db3-b9c2-bd41d81c6076",
                                "sense_id": "f963f5a9-2ab7-3ef3-a122-779ff8edea85",
                                "text": "Да́рья Миха́йловна действи́тельно не люби́ла стесня́ть себя́ в дере́вне, и в свобо́дной простоте́ её обхожде́ния замеча́лся лёгкий отте́нок презре́ния столи́чной льви́цы к окружа́вшим её, дово́льно тёмным и ме́лким существа́м…",
                                "translation": "Darya Mihailovna certainly did not care to stand on ceremony in the country, and in the unconstrained frankness of her manners there was perceptible a slight shade of the contempt of the lioness of the capital for the petty and obscure creatures who surrounded her.",
                                "english": "Darya Mihailovna certainly did not care to stand on ceremony in the country, and in the unconstrained frankness of her manners there was perceptible a slight shade of the contempt of the lioness of the capital for the petty and obscure creatures who surrounded her."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
